{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Also a brother to a master is the one who destroys</b> — that which is in his possession. And he said 'brother' because he resembles him in destroying his work, as in 'and he did a brother, for an evil deed' — he is a brother to transgressions."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:27.344775956Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}